{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04970","headline":"陇头水 · 员半千","name":"陇头水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路出金河道，山连玉塞门。\n旌旗云里度，杨柳曲中喧。\n喋血多壮胆，裹革无怯魂。\n严霜敛曙色，大明辞朝暾。\n尘销营卒垒，沙静都尉垣。\n雾卷白山出，风吹黄叶翻。\n将军献凯入，万里绝河源。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"员半千","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}